    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00051" num="00051" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>51</b>. The membrane of <claim-ref idref="CLM-00030">claim 30</claim-ref>, wherein the membrane has one or more of a porosity ≧20.0%, a normalized pin puncture strength ≧1.0×102 mN/μm, and a 105° C. heat shrinkage ≦10.0% in at least one direction.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00052" num="00052" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>52</b>. A battery separator film comprising the membrane of <claim-ref idref="CLM-00028">claim 28</claim-ref>.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00053" num="00053" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>53</b>. A battery separator film comprising the membrane of <claim-ref idref="CLM-00030">claim 30</claim-ref>.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00054" num="00054" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>54</b>. A battery separator film comprising the membrane of <claim-ref idref="CLM-00032">claim 32</claim-ref>.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00055" num="00055" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>55</b>. The battery separator film of <claim-ref idref="CLM-00039">claim 39</claim-ref>, wherein the battery separator film has a 130° C. TD heat shrinkage ≦25.0%, a 170° C. TD heat shrinkage ≦55.0%, and a normalized pin puncture strength ≧1.4×102 mN/μm.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00056" num="00056" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>56</b>. The battery separator film of <claim-ref idref="CLM-00039">claim 39</claim-ref>, wherein the layer is a skin layer.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00057" num="00057" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>57</b>. A lithium ion battery comprising the battery separator film of <claim-ref idref="CLM-00038">claim 38</claim-ref>.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00058" num="00058" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>58</b>. A lithium ion battery comprising the battery separator film of <claim-ref idref="CLM-00042">claim 42</claim-ref>.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00059" num="00059" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>59</b>. A lithium ion battery comprising the battery separator film of <claim-ref idref="CLM-00043">claim 43</claim-ref>.</div>
    </div>
  </div> </div>
  </div>
